; nvr-metric-band.fk — the ≥ rented metric is registered before any claim.
;
; Verdict 511:
;   1      faithfulness is weighted twice
;   2      a more-faithful native beats
;   4      a tie earns (equal counts)
;   8      extra fluency does not buy a faithfulness miss
;   16     an empty corpus is not ready
;   32     a winning score on an empty corpus does not earn
;   64     same score, registered metric, full corpus earns
;   128    a substitute metric (other id) does not earn
;   256    the registered id is held
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk form-stdlib/native-vs-rented.fk observe/nvr-metric.fk

(do (nvrm-check))
